Salvado Tarragona is a short, stocky man whose leathery skin bears the scars of a long career underground. He was athletic once and has gone soft and pale, with deep sunken eyes, through a lifetime of heavy drinking.

Salvado is a member of [[Org/Solari Sub-surface/index|Solari Sub-surface]].

He speaks for Solari Sub-surface among the guests. When the tithe rose past what the company could pay, Solari Sub-surface joined the Party's alliance; its people are moving to berth 14 while the [[Org/Protectorate/index|Protectorate]] takes its territory.

[[People/Argyle|Argyle]] has since cured him of his drinking, a change he is not sure he wanted. He talks of turning over a new leaf and is willing to learn to fight, where the two clerks who came with him are not. He is no fighter, and says so.
